# Uleguerand - Dominion Op #03 (abyssea 103, op 576): a level 99 Warrior in Abyssea - Uleguerand; the op's target
# Sub-zero_Gear (16 placed spawns, the first 17813833). The next op (#04, Snowflake) and Altepa's and Grauberg's #03
# accepted (a GM), this op available: a Sub-zero_Gear killed: no section: nothing. This op accepted (a GM;
# activeDominionOp stays 0, which dominionOnMobDeath does not read): a Sub-zero_Gear killed: dominionOnMobDeath(576):
# Quest[8][103]Prog 1 (FOV_DEFEATED_TARGET 1 of 5). The next op's Snowflake killed: Quest[8][104]Prog 1 (its own count),
# this op's unchanged. Prog 4 (a GM): one more: Prog 5 (5 of 5); another: the count is full (numDefeated < 5 is false):
# nothing. Completed (Prog 0, as completeDominionOp leaves it; a GM): another killed: no section: nothing.
# Abyssea - Uleguerand's IDs.lua names no mob, so each kill names its mob by id (kill #<id>). Perfect Dodge, Invincible
# and Elemental Sforzo (GM effects) keep the chars alive through the kills (the Abyssea mobs aggro and link).
lists AbysseaUleguerand/Sub-zero_Gear/onMobDeath AbysseaUleguerand/Snowflake/onMobDeath
char zone=AbysseaUleguerand pos=-240,-40,-520 job=WAR lvl=99
login
effect 49                               # a GM: Perfect Dodge (melee hits evaded)
effect 50                               # a GM: Invincible (no physical damage)
effect 522                              # a GM: Elemental Sforzo (no magic damage)
quest Abyssea.DominionOp04Uleguerand accepted # a GM: the next op
quest Abyssea.DominionOp03Altepa accepted # a GM: Altepa's #03
quest Abyssea.DominionOp03Grauberg accepted # a GM: Grauberg's #03
kill #17813833                          # available: nothing
quest Abyssea.DominionOp03Uleguerand accepted # a GM
kill #17813834                          # accepted: Prog 1
kill #17813733                          # Snowflake: Quest[8][104]Prog 1
charvar Quest[8][103]Prog 4             # a GM
kill #17813835                          # Prog 5
kill #17813836                          # full: nothing
quest Abyssea.DominionOp03Uleguerand completed # a GM
charvar Quest[8][103]Prog 0             # a GM
kill #17813837                          # completed: nothing
